# concepts.src - Heel Turn concept base, authoring form (Boston Crab house format).
# One concept per line:  concept | isa | defs
# The reader works on concepts only. Words point at concepts in lexicon.src.
# Policy effects are in policy.src, keyed by concept, never by word.
#
# --- roots ---
thing||
act||
object|thing|
quality|thing|
cond|thing|
time|thing|
speech|act|
#
# --- acts a player can take ---
attack|act|
defend|act|
support|act|
ally|act|
betray|attack|
lie|speech|
truth|speech|
trust|act|
distrust|act|
promise|speech|
keep|act|
break|act|
expand|act|
build|act|
move|act|
hold|defend|
talk|speech|
silence|speech|
punish|attack|
forgive|act|
balance|act|
win|act|
survive|act|
expect|act|
convoy|act|
plan|act|
remember|act|
be|act|
propose|talk|
request|talk|
offer|talk|
threaten|speech|
accept|speech|
refuse|speech|
thank|speech|
apologise|speech|
accuse|speech|
greet|speech|
praise|talk|
keep-out|act|
ask|request|
tell|talk|
know|act|
want|act|
need|want|
